(4500204, 648296, 67258, '<td valign="top">Whilst I really admire this duo tone with its good tonal range, I am not sure it works well in a leading lines challenge.  The posts to the left off the photo serve to draw my eye out of the photo, rather than towards the subject.  The shadows from the tower add extra interest, but do not fall in such a way as to really lead my eye.</td>', 'Whilst I really admire this duo tone with its good tonal range, I am not sure it works well in a leading lines challenge.  The posts to the left off the photo serve to draw my eye out of the photo, rather than towards the subject.  The shadows from the tower add extra interest, but do not fall in such a way as to really lead my eye.', '2008-02-20 07:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500206, 648824, 47906, '<td valign="top">I like the verticals that come off your diagonal. It really compliments it very well. Great positioning of your model</td>', 'I like the verticals that come off your diagonal. It really compliments it very well. Great positioning of your model', '2008-02-20 07:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500208, 648231, 47906, '<td valign="top">I like your DOF used in this shot, would have liked the actual hole to be shifted to the right just a tad more to make better use of the rule of thirds. Nice lighting overall.</td>', 'I like your DOF used in this shot, would have liked the actual hole to be shifted to the right just a tad more to make better use of the rule of thirds. Nice lighting overall.', '2008-02-20 07:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
