(4500219, 648829, 47906, '<td valign="top">The idea was well thought out, however the photo is a bit small. There is a tutorial on resizing for the web to take advantage of the full size of the photo here.<br/> <br/>On the photo: I like the postioning of the driveway going to the lower right corner. the stone oblisk on the left hand side is a bit distracting. If you could possibly find a place on the driveway that you could redo this with out it I think it would be alot better. Nice postioning of your focal point and your horizon.</td>', 'The idea was well thought out, however the photo is a bit small. There is a tutorial on resizing for the web to take advantage of the full size of the photo here. On the photo: I like the postioning of the driveway going to the lower right corner. the stone oblisk on the left hand side is a bit distracting. If you could possibly find a place on the driveway that you could redo this with out it I think it would be alot better. Nice postioning of your focal point and your horizon.', '2008-02-20 07:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500223, 649057, 47906, '<td valign="top">I really like the clouds in the sky and how they are giveing you some leading lines in to the photo. The photo feels a bit tilted to the right. If you use photoshop you can fix this by using rotate canvas, counter clockwise by about 0.3. I like the reflections in the water, good positioning of your horizon.</td>', 'I really like the clouds in the sky and how they are giveing you some leading lines in to the photo. The photo feels a bit tilted to the right. If you use photoshop you can fix this by using rotate canvas, counter clockwise by about 0.3. I like the reflections in the water, good positioning of your horizon.', '2008-02-20 07:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500231, 649055, 47906, '<td valign="top">What a great photo, nice leading lines created by the walk way and great diagonals everywhere else. Nice colors on the arches, great detail and sharpness throughout the photo.  I give you an 8 .<br/> <br/> Not that you could do anything about it but once the challenge is over you should get rid of the green dot right above the left arch (not going to count it in the score as it is basic editing)</td>', 'What a great photo, nice leading lines created by the walk way and great diagonals everywhere else. Nice colors on the arches, great detail and sharpness throughout the photo.  I give you an 8 .  Not that you could do anything about it but once the challenge is over you should get rid of the green dot right above the left arch (not going to count it in the score as it is basic editing)', '2008-02-20 08:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500234, 649007, 47906, '<td valign="top">This is a fun photo, I like the colors and the idea. The curves of the pencils are really interesting, Watch the lighting on the right side as there are some areas of the pencils that are over exposed. A bit larger DOF would have given you more detail in the erasers in the foreground.</td>', 'This is a fun photo, I like the colors and the idea. The curves of the pencils are really interesting, Watch the lighting on the right side as there are some areas of the pencils that are over exposed. A bit larger DOF would have given you more detail in the erasers in the foreground.', '2008-02-20 08:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500239, 649055, 51538, '<td valign="top">Glad I didn''t do this one ;-)  I was tempted.7.</td>', 'Glad I didn''t do this one ;-)  I was tempted.7.', '2008-02-20 08:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500249, 647213, 51538, '<td valign="top">I thought of the same location too.  It was a bit wet so did not have the opportunity.  I think the camera viewpoint would be better down low with more of a wide angle shot.  0.02 cents.</td>', 'I thought of the same location too.  It was a bit wet so did not have the opportunity.  I think the camera viewpoint would be better down low with more of a wide angle shot.  0.02 cents.', '2008-02-20 08:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500255, 648997, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot, a bit dark, it makes it a moody photo, I like how you created the star from what I am guessing is the moon? The darkness actually adds to the fact that the tracks are shining into the vanshing point. I like the positioning of the horizon in the photo as well I think it really helps in this perspective and gives depth. <br/> <br/>(Not included in voting cause it is basic editing)<br/>Looks like the flash was a little harsh on the right side track in the foreground. May want to try cloning the left track to give a bit of detail once the challenge is over.</td>', 'Nice perspective shot, a bit dark, it makes it a moody photo, I like how you created the star from what I am guessing is the moon? The darkness actually adds to the fact that the tracks are shining into the vanshing point. I like the positioning of the horizon in the photo as well I think it really helps in this perspective and gives depth.  (Not included in voting cause it is basic editing)Looks like the flash was a little harsh on the right side track in the foreground. May want to try cloning the left track to give a bit of detail once the challenge is over.', '2008-02-20 08:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500258, 647073, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice location and composition.  The softness of the image is appealing.  I find the frame very distracting.  It formalizes the picture and says "this phot is endorsed as real art."  But it stands in the way of my viewing. 6.</td>', 'Nice location and composition.  The softness of the image is appealing.  I find the frame very distracting.  It formalizes the picture and says "this phot is endorsed as real art."  But it stands in the way of my viewing. 6.', '2008-02-20 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500260, 648561, 51538, '<td valign="top">"Going somewhere" photos attract me at present.  I like the gritty imperfect image. Imperfection is suitably emotive for "on the road" photos, IMO.  7.</td>', '"Going somewhere" photos attract me at present.  I like the gritty imperfect image. Imperfection is suitably emotive for "on the road" photos, IMO.  7.', '2008-02-20 08:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500263, 648757, 51538, '<td valign="top">I could do with a snack at that station cafe.  I feel "on the road-ish" lately so this appeals to me.  Going places and those lines lead me off on trip. 7.</td>', 'I could do with a snack at that station cafe.  I feel "on the road-ish" lately so this appeals to me.  Going places and those lines lead me off on trip. 7.', '2008-02-20 08:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500298, 648846, 88561, '<td valign="top">The primary draw into the photo is the red in the sign.  The post doesn''t act as much of a lead to me, nor do the tracks add as leading lines.</td>', 'The primary draw into the photo is the red in the sign.  The post doesn''t act as much of a lead to me, nor do the tracks add as leading lines.', '2008-02-20 08:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500299, 648597, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, Good timed exposure to capture the cars like that. I like how you got the diagonal to almost totally accross the frame, I like the rule of third placement for it as well. Great perspective I like the view that we are above the roadway. <br/> <br/>(Not included in voting as it is basic editing)<br/>Once the challenge is over I would go back and try to tone down the light in the center and the sign on the building as the brightness attracts my attention to those points first.</td>', 'Nice night shot, Good timed exposure to capture the cars like that. I like how you got the diagonal to almost totally accross the frame, I like the rule of third placement for it as well. Great perspective I like the view that we are above the roadway.  (Not included in voting as it is basic editing)Once the challenge is over I would go back and try to tone down the light in the center and the sign on the building as the brightness attracts my attention to those points first.', '2008-02-20 08:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500308, 648112, 88561, '<td valign="top">I found the murky water in the boat the eye draw.  I was not led in by a line.</td>', 'I found the murky water in the boat the eye draw.  I was not led in by a line.', '2008-02-20 08:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500319, 648172, 47906, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, could be a definiate contender. I love the positioning of the jetty, great entry into the photo and great ending point almost on your right vertical of the thirds. The horizon is perfectly placed and the colors are very beautiful. Phenominal lighting on the jetty as well. I love the detail present in the wood. Great Shot 10.<br/> <br/> <br/>(Not included in voting as it is basic editing)<br/>Would really love to see you take out the lights on the jetty out, its my only nit pock to this lovely image.</td>', 'beautiful shot, could be a definiate contender. I love the positioning of the jetty, great entry into the photo and great ending point almost on your right vertical of the thirds. The horizon is perfectly placed and the colors are very beautiful. Phenominal lighting on the jetty as well. I love the detail present in the wood. Great Shot 10.  (Not included in voting as it is basic editing)Would really love to see you take out the lights on the jetty out, its my only nit pock to this lovely image.', '2008-02-20 08:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500334, 648803, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very nice symmetric shot, I think the fog establishing the vanishing point really gives interes to this photo. The detail and sharpness is good, like the yellow on the centerline its the perfect color to give a foggy day feel. <br/> <br/>Great composition.</td>', 'Very nice symmetric shot, I think the fog establishing the vanishing point really gives interes to this photo. The detail and sharpness is good, like the yellow on the centerline its the perfect color to give a foggy day feel.  Great composition.', '2008-02-20 08:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500349, 648288, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective, great control of your white balance. Great leading lines from the lower left hand corner. The sky is an amazing tone of blue, what type of circ polarizer where you using?  Great detail, sharpness and color tone throughout. <br/> <br/>You have something funky going on in the upper left corner in the shawdow.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective, great control of your white balance. Great leading lines from the lower left hand corner. The sky is an amazing tone of blue, what type of circ polarizer where you using?  Great detail, sharpness and color tone throughout.  You have something funky going on in the upper left corner in the shawdow.', '2008-02-20 08:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500351, 648114, 88561, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture!  I found the lights and buildings drew my eye.  You did a fantastic job on this shot, I wish the roadways led my eye more.  To me they enhanced the photo, but just didn''t lead me into it.  I am definitly a left to right dominate person so that may play into my scoring.  7</td>', 'Lovely picture!  I found the lights and buildings drew my eye.  You did a fantastic job on this shot, I wish the roadways led my eye more.  To me they enhanced the photo, but just didn''t lead me into it.  I am definitly a left to right dominate person so that may play into my scoring.  7', '2008-02-20 08:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
