(4500371, 648936, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the sky. Good leading line created by the jetty to the light house. I like your point of entry of the jetty and the placement of the lighthouse on your left vertical. Nice placement of your horizon also. Could just be me, but I think its a bit soft overall and could use a bit of sharpness added to it overall.  Also my opinion again, there is alot of sky at the top that isnt really visually interesting, doesnt add to much to the photo. A bit off the top could really make this photo pop.</td>', 'Nice colors in the sky. Good leading line created by the jetty to the light house. I like your point of entry of the jetty and the placement of the lighthouse on your left vertical. Nice placement of your horizon also. Could just be me, but I think its a bit soft overall and could use a bit of sharpness added to it overall.  Also my opinion again, there is alot of sky at the top that isnt really visually interesting, doesnt add to much to the photo. A bit off the top could really make this photo pop.', '2008-02-20 08:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
