(4500380, 646930, 79955, '<td valign="top">great job creating the drops, my problem with this image is that it is a little flat with very little perspective.</td>', 'great job creating the drops, my problem with this image is that it is a little flat with very little perspective.', '2008-02-20 08:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4500385, 648654, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I live the positioning of the red boat, it really adds to this photo. Great positioning of your horizon and the perspective of the shot, gives really dramatic depth to the photo. I also like the amount of detail in the foreground the sharpness and clarity of the rocks is great and really adds interest to the photo. This should be in the top 10.</td>', 'Great shot, I live the positioning of the red boat, it really adds to this photo. Great positioning of your horizon and the perspective of the shot, gives really dramatic depth to the photo. I also like the amount of detail in the foreground the sharpness and clarity of the rocks is great and really adds interest to the photo. This should be in the top 10.', '2008-02-20 08:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
