(4500406, 648271, 88561, '<td valign="top">I love shots of ships.  I would have maybe cropped tighter on the right, the skyline is nice, but not sure it adds much to the photo, and captured more of the hull.  Would have been nice to see the full aft of her. Nice crisp focus, nice lighting.  I like the shadows, and I like that you captured the ice surrounding the hull.  Another plus, your horizon is straight.  Very well composed overall.  I really enjoyed this shot.</td>', 'I love shots of ships.  I would have maybe cropped tighter on the right, the skyline is nice, but not sure it adds much to the photo, and captured more of the hull.  Would have been nice to see the full aft of her. Nice crisp focus, nice lighting.  I like the shadows, and I like that you captured the ice surrounding the hull.  Another plus, your horizon is straight.  Very well composed overall.  I really enjoyed this shot.', '2008-02-20 09:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
