(4500620, 648952, 83375, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I wish though that the sign (#8??) wasn''t in the frame as I think it distracts and the lone interruption would be more impactful.</td>', 'Love it.  I wish though that the sign (#8??) wasn''t in the frame as I think it distracts and the lone interruption would be more impactful.', '2008-02-20 10:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
