(4500623, 648198, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''m fond of the toning on this one.  It just seems way too sepia, and it seems like it was used for the sake of using it without a good reason.</td>', 'I can''t say I''m fond of the toning on this one.  It just seems way too sepia, and it seems like it was used for the sake of using it without a good reason.', '2008-02-20 10:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
