(4500636, 648604, 83375, '<td valign="top">Good composition and take on the challenge.  I like the high contrast look but looks a little too overexposed in her hair.</td>', 'Good composition and take on the challenge.  I like the high contrast look but looks a little too overexposed in her hair.', '2008-02-20 10:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
