(4500642, 648772, 83375, '<td valign="top">Ha, had to return to leave a comment after leaving a vote.  Mermaids don''t have feet, perhaps the pun was intended?</td>', 'Ha, had to return to leave a comment after leaving a vote.  Mermaids don''t have feet, perhaps the pun was intended?', '2008-02-20 10:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
