(4501017, 649001, 47906, '<td valign="top">I like the high key attempt at this photo, but I think you are loosing alot of the texture and foreground interest that would have helped draw you into the frame alot more. I like that you do not have the middle board centered makes it stronger this way.</td>', 'I like the high key attempt at this photo, but I think you are loosing alot of the texture and foreground interest that would have helped draw you into the frame alot more. I like that you do not have the middle board centered makes it stronger this way.', '2008-02-20 12:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501022, 648145, 90003, '<td valign="top">without the sandal it could have been better</td>', 'without the sandal it could have been better', '2008-02-20 12:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501026, 648715, 47906, '<td valign="top">I like how symetric this photo is, really good perspective and composition. Good job on what looks like tough lighting as well because od all the reflective sufaces.</td>', 'I like how symetric this photo is, really good perspective and composition. Good job on what looks like tough lighting as well because od all the reflective sufaces.', '2008-02-20 12:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
