(4501031, 647309, 47906, '<td valign="top">Good job with the white balance, I like the reflections of the tree in the water. Very nice B&amp;W image.</td>', 'Good job with the white balance, I like the reflections of the tree in the water. Very nice B&W image.', '2008-02-20 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501037, 649047, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great interest on in this perspective. I love the long exposure on this shot. Excellent sharpness and detail throughout. Should make top 10.</td>', 'Great interest on in this perspective. I love the long exposure on this shot. Excellent sharpness and detail throughout. Should make top 10.', '2008-02-20 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501043, 649018, 47906, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone, good contrast and detail, it really works in this photo. I like how the tracks enter the photo on the lower right corner. Good leading line/diagonal created on by the train.</td>', 'The sepia tone, good contrast and detail, it really works in this photo. I like how the tracks enter the photo on the lower right corner. Good leading line/diagonal created on by the train.', '2008-02-20 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501051, 648995, 88453, '<td valign="top">wtf</td>', 'wtf', '2008-02-20 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501057, 647996, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great white balance and tonal range. I like the detail in the fence unit in the foreground. The fog in the background is very interesting.</td>', 'Great white balance and tonal range. I like the detail in the fence unit in the foreground. The fog in the background is very interesting.', '2008-02-20 12:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501062, 647502, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice prespective, very nice lighting. I like the reflection of the pieces onto the board. A bit noisy in the white squares.</td>', 'Nice prespective, very nice lighting. I like the reflection of the pieces onto the board. A bit noisy in the white squares.', '2008-02-20 12:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501076, 648789, 47906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and exposure. Great positioning of the monument. Excellent colors and detail through out. Should be a top 10 image.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and exposure. Great positioning of the monument. Excellent colors and detail through out. Should be a top 10 image.', '2008-02-20 12:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501079, 648497, 53710, '<td valign="top">great use of black and white</td>', 'great use of black and white', '2008-02-20 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501086, 647597, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great exposure, Lovely colors and composition. I love the size comparison done with the model vs the waterfall Great use of the frame</td>', 'Great exposure, Lovely colors and composition. I love the size comparison done with the model vs the waterfall Great use of the frame', '2008-02-20 12:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501088, 648015, 53710, '<td valign="top">the color use is great</td>', 'the color use is great', '2008-02-20 12:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501103, 648015, 47906, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, I like the foreground detail in the rocks, and the nice color in the sky. I think a graduated ND may have helped retain some of the color in the sky better as you had a longer exposure.</td>', 'Good perspective, I like the foreground detail in the rocks, and the nice color in the sky. I think a graduated ND may have helped retain some of the color in the sky better as you had a longer exposure.', '2008-02-20 12:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501115, 648766, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W, I love the feel of depth I get when looking at this photo, Great positioning of the entry point and the ending point on the highway. I also like the fact that you have 2 sets of leading lines in your photo. Great tones and contrasts help to make this a powerful image. Should do well.</td>', 'Great B&W, I love the feel of depth I get when looking at this photo, Great positioning of the entry point and the ending point on the highway. I also like the fact that you have 2 sets of leading lines in your photo. Great tones and contrasts help to make this a powerful image. Should do well.', '2008-02-20 13:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501123, 647704, 47906, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is absolutely beautiful! Stunning 10... I am going to guess the Tetons perhaps?  I am definately putting you in my top 3.</td>', 'Wow. This is absolutely beautiful! Stunning 10... I am going to guess the Tetons perhaps?  I am definately putting you in my top 3.', '2008-02-20 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501129, 648065, 47906, '<td valign="top">I really like the selective desat on this image, The little bit of color on the child aided by the fence really gives you depth to this image. Excellent job.</td>', 'I really like the selective desat on this image, The little bit of color on the child aided by the fence really gives you depth to this image. Excellent job.', '2008-02-20 13:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501136, 648645, 90113, '<td valign="top">Great use of leading lines.  I love how your eye goes out the dock, turns right, and heads right for the sun.  Nice job!</td>', 'Great use of leading lines.  I love how your eye goes out the dock, turns right, and heads right for the sun.  Nice job!', '2008-02-20 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501252, 648500, 18738, '<td valign="top">The problem is that these lines lead me away from the subject. I stare at the blurred greenery at the edge of the frame and wonder whether you really wanted an OOF foreground or whether you simply didn''t think about the depth of field required.<br/> <br/>The detail in the photo is hidden because of the small complex subject(s) and the low resolution. Perhaps this would work better as a print, but it certainly doesn''t here.</td>', 'The problem is that these lines lead me away from the subject. I stare at the blurred greenery at the edge of the frame and wonder whether you really wanted an OOF foreground or whether you simply didn''t think about the depth of field required. The detail in the photo is hidden because of the small complex subject(s) and the low resolution. Perhaps this would work better as a print, but it certainly doesn''t here.', '2008-02-20 13:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501257, 648912, 18738, '<td valign="top">Hard to look at. There''s something about the relationship between the tree and the background that hurts.<br/> <br/>And yet it is a strong subject.</td>', 'Hard to look at. There''s something about the relationship between the tree and the background that hurts. And yet it is a strong subject.', '2008-02-20 13:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501260, 647879, 18738, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.</td>', 'Great stuff.', '2008-02-20 13:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501265, 648997, 18738, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far. I like the hint of asymmetry of the lines. It turns an average composition into a beautiful one.</td>', 'My favourite so far. I like the hint of asymmetry of the lines. It turns an average composition into a beautiful one.', '2008-02-20 13:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501284, 648954, 67723, '<td valign="top">That''s a fun place to stand on.  Especially when you get 50 mile an hour winds trying to knock you off. lol Good shot</td>', 'That''s a fun place to stand on.  Especially when you get 50 mile an hour winds trying to knock you off. lol Good shot', '2008-02-20 13:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
