(4501434, 648824, 90451, '<td valign="top">A lovely combination of lines that creates a very nicely balanced picture.  I like the curve in the model''s back.  Good job.</td>', 'A lovely combination of lines that creates a very nicely balanced picture.  I like the curve in the model''s back.  Good job.', '2008-02-20 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
