(4501437, 648779, 89774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2008-02-20 14:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501438, 648198, 86799, '<td valign="top">Maybe some fill flash to light up his face more.  Nice comp, just needs some more accent on what the lines are leading to.</td>', 'Maybe some fill flash to light up his face more.  Nice comp, just needs some more accent on what the lines are leading to.', '2008-02-20 14:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501440, 648767, 90451, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome contrast of the dark clouds and the surreally light grass.  Excellent assortment of lines, and a wonderfully balanced composition. Only thing that would enhance the photography would be to clone out the while line in the dark cloud (which I understand you can''t do in this particular competition).  Great job.</td>', 'Wow, awesome contrast of the dark clouds and the surreally light grass.  Excellent assortment of lines, and a wonderfully balanced composition. Only thing that would enhance the photography would be to clone out the while line in the dark cloud (which I understand you can''t do in this particular competition).  Great job.', '2008-02-20 15:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501442, 646960, 90451, '<td valign="top">Very nice highkey exposure. I like the combination of the horizon line and swoopy lines of the electric cables.</td>', 'Very nice highkey exposure. I like the combination of the horizon line and swoopy lines of the electric cables.', '2008-02-20 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501443, 647704, 90451, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and good composition combining leading line and rule of thirds.  Congrats!</td>', 'Excellent capture and good composition combining leading line and rule of thirds.  Congrats!', '2008-02-20 15:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501444, 646930, 90451, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and combination of lines.  Love the linearity in the reflections on the water drops.  Nice!</td>', 'Lovely color and combination of lines.  Love the linearity in the reflections on the water drops.  Nice!', '2008-02-20 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501455, 648528, 90451, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, indeed.  My only advice would be to crop out a bit more of the blue sky so the composition isn''t bisected, and perhaps use a bit faster an f-stop to increase the DOF so that clarity of the sand line extends further.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice shot, indeed.  My only advice would be to crop out a bit more of the blue sky so the composition isn''t bisected, and perhaps use a bit faster an f-stop to increase the DOF so that clarity of the sand line extends further.  Good job.', '2008-02-20 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501459, 648888, 56502, '<td valign="top">Whatever a moke is - nice idea anyway.</td>', 'Whatever a moke is - nice idea anyway.', '2008-02-20 15:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501462, 648936, 90451, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion and use of line.  I like it a lot.  My only suggestions might be to crop a bit of the clouds off to balance the photo closer to thirds.  Also perhaps adjust the WB a bit to brighten the snow -- though I also really like the bluish surrealism you capture. Nice!</td>', 'Very nice compostion and use of line.  I like it a lot.  My only suggestions might be to crop a bit of the clouds off to balance the photo closer to thirds.  Also perhaps adjust the WB a bit to brighten the snow -- though I also really like the bluish surrealism you capture. Nice!', '2008-02-20 15:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501465, 648817, 86799, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a little flat, needs a little sparkle &amp; punch.  Nice idea, though.</td>', 'Lighting''s a little flat, needs a little sparkle & punch.  Nice idea, though.', '2008-02-20 15:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
