(4501471, 649018, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I think it would be slightly better if the tracks were leading your eyes to the train a little more</td>', 'Nice picture, I think it would be slightly better if the tracks were leading your eyes to the train a little more', '2008-02-20 15:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501474, 648015, 90451, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition. Nice colors and use of lines.  I wonder what the photo would look like if the pylons extended a bit beyond the horizon.  I mention this because while the photo is so well balanced, the left wooden stringer breaks the symmetry with an off angle, so I curious if extending the pylons to break the horizon symmetry might restore balance.  Not sure. Regardless, great job.</td>', 'Very cool composition. Nice colors and use of lines.  I wonder what the photo would look like if the pylons extended a bit beyond the horizon.  I mention this because while the photo is so well balanced, the left wooden stringer breaks the symmetry with an off angle, so I curious if extending the pylons to break the horizon symmetry might restore balance.  Not sure. Regardless, great job.', '2008-02-20 15:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501477, 648223, 86799, '<td valign="top">VERY cool.  Very illusory and provocative.  Good angle, lines and crop.</td>', 'VERY cool.  Very illusory and provocative.  Good angle, lines and crop.', '2008-02-20 15:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
