(4503292, 648860, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Would like the lighting to be a little higher. Also find the 2 dots in the upper right distracting.</td>', 'Nice capture. Would like the lighting to be a little higher. Also find the 2 dots in the upper right distracting.', '2008-02-21 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503294, 648743, 89940, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little too flat and a little too much noise in the photo for my taste.</td>', 'The lighting is a little too flat and a little too much noise in the photo for my taste.', '2008-02-21 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503297, 647932, 89940, '<td valign="top">The foreground is too busy and distracting. I like the framing with the trees but would probably crop out most of the left edge and some of the bottom.</td>', 'The foreground is too busy and distracting. I like the framing with the trees but would probably crop out most of the left edge and some of the bottom.', '2008-02-21 01:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503305, 648625, 89940, '<td valign="top">Colors seema little washed out</td>', 'Colors seema little washed out', '2008-02-21 01:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503311, 648522, 89940, '<td valign="top">Great color and lighting</td>', 'Great color and lighting', '2008-02-21 01:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503313, 647309, 37252, '<td valign="top">A postcard shot - I think it''s beautiful.</td>', 'A postcard shot - I think it''s beautiful.', '2008-02-21 01:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503316, 648767, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. I like the blue tint too.</td>', 'Very nicely composed. I like the blue tint too.', '2008-02-21 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503326, 646930, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very cool, love the color gradiant in the background. Really like how all the drops are the same size. The spacing on the middle dots is symetrical, and the others are not which is a little distracting but that''s really just a nit. Best image so far.</td>', 'Very cool, love the color gradiant in the background. Really like how all the drops are the same size. The spacing on the middle dots is symetrical, and the others are not which is a little distracting but that''s really just a nit. Best image so far.', '2008-02-21 01:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503327, 648924, 89940, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you can get lines in many different directions. Angle works very well. Nice color. One of the better images I''ve seen.</td>', 'I really like the way you can get lines in many different directions. Angle works very well. Nice color. One of the better images I''ve seen.', '2008-02-21 01:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503328, 647650, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and lighting. Really like the unsymmetrical symmetry (does that make sense). One of the top images so far.</td>', 'Very nice color and lighting. Really like the unsymmetrical symmetry (does that make sense). One of the top images so far.', '2008-02-21 01:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503329, 646930, 37252, '<td valign="top">The drops are exposed well, and have nice window reflections in them. There is a small white dot in the center to the background that I find distracting.<br/>As for the challenge theme - the drops really don''t lead me anywhere but out of the image.</td>', 'The drops are exposed well, and have nice window reflections in them. There is a small white dot in the center to the background that I find distracting.As for the challenge theme - the drops really don''t lead me anywhere but out of the image.', '2008-02-21 01:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503345, 648495, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - would like a bit more contrast though. Not a lot - just a tad more. Still this should score very well.</td>', 'Very cool shot - would like a bit more contrast though. Not a lot - just a tad more. Still this should score very well.', '2008-02-21 02:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503348, 649016, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, and well executed. I love the sepia tones.</td>', 'Excellent idea, and well executed. I love the sepia tones.', '2008-02-21 02:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503441, 648924, 88523, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo...  I really like the contrasts. Where/what is this? (Don''t say windows).</td>', 'Fantastic photo...  I really like the contrasts. Where/what is this? (Don''t say windows).', '2008-02-21 03:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503442, 648114, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very cool how one makes out the buildings by the lights even though there isn''t a skyline.</td>', 'Very cool how one makes out the buildings by the lights even though there isn''t a skyline.', '2008-02-21 03:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503444, 647996, 88523, '<td valign="top">I like the shades of white broken by the fence and trees.  I wonder what it would look like with a perspective shot closer the fence on the left...</td>', 'I like the shades of white broken by the fence and trees.  I wonder what it would look like with a perspective shot closer the fence on the left...', '2008-02-21 03:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503449, 648354, 88523, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. There seem to be lighter tints in the background which are a liiiittle distracting.</td>', 'Good use of negative space. There seem to be lighter tints in the background which are a liiiittle distracting.', '2008-02-21 03:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503452, 647849, 88523, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black and White.  The piece of metal to the left is a bit too dominating for me.</td>', 'I like the use of black and White.  The piece of metal to the left is a bit too dominating for me.', '2008-02-21 03:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503453, 648919, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Did you stumble onto this or did it spring to mind?</td>', 'Great shot!  Did you stumble onto this or did it spring to mind?', '2008-02-21 03:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503465, 646688, 88523, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...clever use of light and shadow.</td>', 'Hmmm...clever use of light and shadow.', '2008-02-21 03:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503467, 647888, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  The red coat works very well.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  The red coat works very well.', '2008-02-21 03:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503469, 648503, 88523, '<td valign="top">The BW works very well.  Would''ve liked to see more of the fence.</td>', 'The BW works very well.  Would''ve liked to see more of the fence.', '2008-02-21 03:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503553, 647966, 79955, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot !! really like it. Would have been perfect w/o thee person in the background (to bad due to basic editing). The impact &amp; the tones is really great. into my favs. 8</td>', 'Fantastic shot !! really like it. Would have been perfect w/o thee person in the background (to bad due to basic editing). The impact & the tones is really great. into my favs. 8', '2008-02-21 05:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503558, 648976, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  I would like it even more without the reflection.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  I would like it even more without the reflection.', '2008-02-21 05:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503561, 649015, 88523, '<td valign="top">I like the color tones, I would like the photo even more if it weren''t quite as narrow.</td>', 'I like the color tones, I would like the photo even more if it weren''t quite as narrow.', '2008-02-21 05:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503562, 647466, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great shot and sky!</td>', 'Great shot and sky!', '2008-02-21 05:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503563, 648495, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and shades of green.</td>', 'Great perspective and shades of green.', '2008-02-21 05:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503572, 649057, 86443, '<td valign="top">This looks like...Black River, Jamaica??<br/>This is an inviting shot that makes me wish I were there instead of freezing in the city!</td>', 'This looks like...Black River, Jamaica??This is an inviting shot that makes me wish I were there instead of freezing in the city!', '2008-02-21 06:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503591, 649057, 86799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I need a kayak...</td>', 'Beautiful.  I need a kayak...', '2008-02-21 06:34:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4503592, 647416, 86799, '<td valign="top">Good catch!</td>', 'Good catch!', '2008-02-21 06:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503593, 648707, 86799, '<td valign="top">Very very nice.  Good comp.</td>', 'Very very nice.  Good comp.', '2008-02-21 06:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503595, 646960, 68514, '<td valign="top">Nice work. The simple landscape works well with the lines.</td>', 'Nice work. The simple landscape works well with the lines.', '2008-02-21 06:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503776, 648707, 8367, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture; breathtaking! Good luck.</td>', 'Awesome capture; breathtaking! Good luck.', '2008-02-21 09:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503779, 648499, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great comp and exposure. A like your subject choice. Very colorful.</td>', 'Great comp and exposure. A like your subject choice. Very colorful.', '2008-02-21 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503791, 648881, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice classic leading lines. Good choice for bw.</td>', 'Nice classic leading lines. Good choice for bw.', '2008-02-21 09:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503795, 648522, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Leads you right in and through. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Leads you right in and through. Nice job.', '2008-02-21 09:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503797, 648276, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2008-02-21 09:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503827, 647956, 8367, '<td valign="top">Love the smooth silky water. The stone building in the bg looks beautiful. I''d like to see more.</td>', 'Love the smooth silky water. The stone building in the bg looks beautiful. I''d like to see more.', '2008-02-21 09:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503918, 647463, 32084, '<td valign="top">The lines of flow take me up and out of the image, but I believe your main point of interest is at the bottom.  This is likely just a different operspective thing where others may be broght down to your subject.  Interesting.</td>', 'The lines of flow take me up and out of the image, but I believe your main point of interest is at the bottom.  This is likely just a different operspective thing where others may be broght down to your subject.  Interesting.', '2008-02-21 09:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503920, 648499, 32084, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it feels a little like there are too many lines that are competing.</td>', 'I like it, but it feels a little like there are too many lines that are competing.', '2008-02-21 09:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503928, 648317, 32084, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but here it feels as if there are too many lines that are competing.</td>', 'I like the idea, but here it feels as if there are too many lines that are competing.', '2008-02-21 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503959, 648233, 71651, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a striking image if there was less noise in the photo.</td>', 'I think this could have been a striking image if there was less noise in the photo.', '2008-02-21 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503986, 647688, 71651, '<td valign="top">So much for voting for these on my break at work. This is definitely NSFW.</td>', 'So much for voting for these on my break at work. This is definitely NSFW.', '2008-02-21 10:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504129, 647405, 18738, '<td valign="top">The border ruins it. You have a picture that gives a sense of a wide, open space hemmed in by an ugly frame.</td>', 'The border ruins it. You have a picture that gives a sense of a wide, open space hemmed in by an ugly frame.', '2008-02-21 10:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504132, 648715, 18738, '<td valign="top">Well Active Transport may be more accurate.</td>', 'Well Active Transport may be more accurate.', '2008-02-21 10:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504143, 648215, 18738, '<td valign="top">That''s always a tempting prospect that makes for slightly unsatisfying pictures. I think that the problem might be that the trees lining the avenue aren''t tall enough to justify the very central composition. The image is too stolid. Maybe if one were to lie down and use an ultrawide angle lens?</td>', 'That''s always a tempting prospect that makes for slightly unsatisfying pictures. I think that the problem might be that the trees lining the avenue aren''t tall enough to justify the very central composition. The image is too stolid. Maybe if one were to lie down and use an ultrawide angle lens?', '2008-02-21 10:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504154, 646930, 18738, '<td valign="top">It''s competent. The window reflection is either a technical flaw or the only thing of interest in the picture. The same with the uneveness of the line.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry, but it''s just very boring while not being close to perfect enough to impress me on a purely technical level.</td>', 'It''s competent. The window reflection is either a technical flaw or the only thing of interest in the picture. The same with the uneveness of the line. I''m sorry, but it''s just very boring while not being close to perfect enough to impress me on a purely technical level.', '2008-02-21 10:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504160, 648677, 18738, '<td valign="top">Many points for bravery, obnoxiousness and making me feel sick before breakfast.</td>', 'Many points for bravery, obnoxiousness and making me feel sick before breakfast.', '2008-02-21 10:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504162, 647213, 18738, '<td valign="top">Wow, what''s the steel flower thing for?</td>', 'Wow, what''s the steel flower thing for?', '2008-02-21 10:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504170, 648911, 18738, '<td valign="top">In response to the inevitable <a href="//xkcd.com/123/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pedantry.</a></td>', 'In response to the inevitable pedantry.', '2008-02-21 10:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504190, 646688, 811, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this shot, and I think it is fairly well done -- compositionally and technically.  My biggest "distraction" if you will is the peacock tail she seems to have.  The shadow cast on the wall begins at her butt and then spreads across the wall.  While it in itself is a leading line contributer, it is extremely distracting to me because it looks like a big tail.</td>', 'Overall, I like this shot, and I think it is fairly well done -- compositionally and technically.  My biggest "distraction" if you will is the peacock tail she seems to have.  The shadow cast on the wall begins at her butt and then spreads across the wall.  While it in itself is a leading line contributer, it is extremely distracting to me because it looks like a big tail.', '2008-02-21 10:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504193, 648836, 811, '<td valign="top">A slightly sharper focus, I think, would have really made this shot stand out more.  I like the way the lights do, though.</td>', 'A slightly sharper focus, I think, would have really made this shot stand out more.  I like the way the lights do, though.', '2008-02-21 10:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504196, 648492, 811, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like it is leading me into the future or unknown.  Technically, it is a fairly good shot, but perhaps just a bit too "common" to be completely captivating.</td>', 'Kinda looks like it is leading me into the future or unknown.  Technically, it is a fairly good shot, but perhaps just a bit too "common" to be completely captivating.', '2008-02-21 11:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504255, 648820, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Since I like the overall feel, contrast and lighting of the pic, I will still give it a 6, but expect to be voted down by quite a number of voters, because they feel it does not meet the challenge. Hope I am wrong though.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Since I like the overall feel, contrast and lighting of the pic, I will still give it a 6, but expect to be voted down by quite a number of voters, because they feel it does not meet the challenge. Hope I am wrong though.', '2008-02-21 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504270, 648724, 45187, '<td valign="top">I think the lines aren''t really "leading" anywhere.  But apart from that it''s a really nice shot.</td>', 'I think the lines aren''t really "leading" anywhere.  But apart from that it''s a really nice shot.', '2008-02-21 11:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504272, 648677, 45187, '<td valign="top">I love the picture but wouldn''t say that the lines are "leading".</td>', 'I love the picture but wouldn''t say that the lines are "leading".', '2008-02-21 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504274, 648908, 45187, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.  Needs work on the exposure front though.</td>', 'Nice lines.  Needs work on the exposure front though.', '2008-02-21 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504282, 647966, 70689, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great pic. I am not a big fan of silhouettes and burnt whites when shooting into the sun, but this one simply works. Great composition with the leading line bending around the sun, and clearly leading to the main subject.<br/> <br/>Could have done without the sepia though</td>', 'I think this is a great pic. I am not a big fan of silhouettes and burnt whites when shooting into the sun, but this one simply works. Great composition with the leading line bending around the sun, and clearly leading to the main subject. Could have done without the sepia though', '2008-02-21 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504288, 648952, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great way to use leading lines, very strong composition. Not too sure about the use of bw here, but that''s no big deal. 8</td>', 'Great way to use leading lines, very strong composition. Not too sure about the use of bw here, but that''s no big deal. 8', '2008-02-21 11:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504318, 647080, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 11:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504323, 646960, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the strong contrast and overall composition of your pic. I do however think it does not meet the challenge for the reason outlined below.<br/> <br/>I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I like the strong contrast and overall composition of your pic. I do however think it does not meet the challenge for the reason outlined below. I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504326, 648000, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 11:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504327, 648352, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 11:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504328, 647470, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
