(4504337, 649019, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 12:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504341, 647650, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
