(4504530, 649008, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice picture ... I''ve looked but I can''t quite see any leading lines, maybe I''m missing something?</td>', 'Nice picture ... I''ve looked but I can''t quite see any leading lines, maybe I''m missing something?', '2008-02-21 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504531, 647966, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2008-02-21 13:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504532, 648752, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504534, 648908, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2008-02-21 13:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4504536, 648946, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.</td>', 'I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.', '2008-02-21 13:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
