(4506210, 647966, 86628, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I would have liked it even more if the photo was cropped right above the horizon.  I don''t think the bottom bit adds anything to the image, in fact, the tilted horizon bothers me a little.</td>', 'This is very nice.  I would have liked it even more if the photo was cropped right above the horizon.  I don''t think the bottom bit adds anything to the image, in fact, the tilted horizon bothers me a little.', '2008-02-22 02:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
