(4506970, 648215, 72268, '<td valign="top">I feel like this could have been a little better in the terms of color. It''s a little drab in colors, however I think it is an interesting photograph, I just wish it was dressed up a little.</td>', 'I feel like this could have been a little better in the terms of color. It''s a little drab in colors, however I think it is an interesting photograph, I just wish it was dressed up a little.', '2008-02-22 11:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
