(4507031, 648172, 33233, '<td valign="top">Unlike other photos of jetties that lead to an empty blue sky, this one leads to an interesting subject...the clouds. Nice shot.</td>', 'Unlike other photos of jetties that lead to an empty blue sky, this one leads to an interesting subject...the clouds. Nice shot.', '2008-02-22 11:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
