(4508841, 648849, 89940, '<td valign="top">Normally not a fan of color casts but this one works well. Would like to have the shadow under the arm be a little less sharp so that the needle could be seen in the groove.</td>', 'Normally not a fan of color casts but this one works well. Would like to have the shadow under the arm be a little less sharp so that the needle could be seen in the groove.', '2008-02-22 23:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
