(4508863, 648495, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting. Looks a little grainy along portions of the spine</td>', 'Nice color and lighting. Looks a little grainy along portions of the spine', '2008-02-22 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
