(4508902, 648794, 90380, '<td valign="top">As far as the leading lines go, I like how each line leads me to the next line, and so on, so my eye stays in the image. Challenge met, as far as I''m concerned, but I do find all the little branches too busy, and my eye gets tired. Also, I think this would have been nicer if it was taken when the sky is darker, so that the colour in the trees could come out a little more. I''d keep trying, you have the right idea.</td>', 'As far as the leading lines go, I like how each line leads me to the next line, and so on, so my eye stays in the image. Challenge met, as far as I''m concerned, but I do find all the little branches too busy, and my eye gets tired. Also, I think this would have been nicer if it was taken when the sky is darker, so that the colour in the trees could come out a little more. I''d keep trying, you have the right idea.', '2008-02-22 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508903, 648767, 89940, '<td valign="top">I''ve already seen this photo (or at least a less cropped version)</td>', 'I''ve already seen this photo (or at least a less cropped version)', '2008-02-23 00:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508905, 648645, 90380, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset, I can imagine how nice it looked in person, but I don''t feel that the prominant lines in this image are leading me to a focal point.</td>', 'Pretty sunset, I can imagine how nice it looked in person, but I don''t feel that the prominant lines in this image are leading me to a focal point.', '2008-02-23 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
