(4508918, 648528, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color gradation on the sky. I don''t like the horizon cutting through the middle of the photo.</td>', 'Nice color gradation on the sky. I don''t like the horizon cutting through the middle of the photo.', '2008-02-23 00:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
