(4509113, 647563, 90380, '<td valign="top">Something about this makes me so dizzy and disoriented! Seriously, I had to look away a few times before I figured out which way was up! I guess pulling me in that far is effective in one way, but the final effect is not pleasant. I''m sure it''s just me though.</td>', 'Something about this makes me so dizzy and disoriented! Seriously, I had to look away a few times before I figured out which way was up! I guess pulling me in that far is effective in one way, but the final effect is not pleasant. I''m sure it''s just me though.', '2008-02-23 01:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509117, 649040, 70377, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, One of the only photo''s that has a subject that the "lines" lead to...</td>', 'I like this photo, One of the only photo''s that has a subject that the "lines" lead to...', '2008-02-23 01:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509119, 648271, 70377, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture... I like the rusty chain, wonder if you should have only included one of the cables?</td>', 'Nice Picture... I like the rusty chain, wonder if you should have only included one of the cables?', '2008-02-23 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509121, 649007, 70377, '<td valign="top">far out.... Not sure how you did this but.</td>', 'far out.... Not sure how you did this but.', '2008-02-23 01:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
