(4509161, 648500, 90380, '<td valign="top">The leading lines meet the challenge, but they are leading to a focal point which is less interesting than the lines themselves.</td>', 'The leading lines meet the challenge, but they are leading to a focal point which is less interesting than the lines themselves.', '2008-02-23 01:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509162, 647294, 70377, '<td valign="top">romantic... LOL</td>', 'romantic... LOL', '2008-02-23 01:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509164, 648992, 70377, '<td valign="top">Nice Quality..</td>', 'Nice Quality..', '2008-02-23 01:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509169, 648820, 90380, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty quality of this image, but like a lot of other images in this challenge, it lacks an interesting focal point. I want something to rest my eyes on rather than just going up and down the lines of the image. It gets tiring after a while.</td>', 'I like the gritty quality of this image, but like a lot of other images in this challenge, it lacks an interesting focal point. I want something to rest my eyes on rather than just going up and down the lines of the image. It gets tiring after a while.', '2008-02-23 01:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509175, 647888, 90380, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the lines and a true subject to meet this challenge. Love the red coat.</td>', 'Excellent use of the lines and a true subject to meet this challenge. Love the red coat.', '2008-02-23 01:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509178, 649025, 90380, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture, but leading lines? I think the lines are the most interesting part, which defeats the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Awesome picture, but leading lines? I think the lines are the most interesting part, which defeats the challenge IMO.', '2008-02-23 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509180, 647294, 90380, '<td valign="top">Creative way to create a line, but the line should lead to something to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Creative way to create a line, but the line should lead to something to meet the challenge.', '2008-02-23 02:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509408, 648761, 8367, '<td valign="top">A classic. Looks great!</td>', 'A classic. Looks great!', '2008-02-23 07:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509409, 649012, 8367, '<td valign="top">A great find. Beautiful structure well captured!</td>', 'A great find. Beautiful structure well captured!', '2008-02-23 07:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509410, 648908, 8367, '<td valign="top">Awesome place! I''ll check back to find out where this is.</td>', 'Awesome place! I''ll check back to find out where this is.', '2008-02-23 07:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509622, 648646, 38411, '<td valign="top">Overall the image seems under exposed and I think the composition would be improved if the road only had one set of tracks.  Though I realize that might not have been possible.</td>', 'Overall the image seems under exposed and I think the composition would be improved if the road only had one set of tracks.  Though I realize that might not have been possible.', '2008-02-23 10:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509633, 648638, 51538, '<td valign="top">Your image fits the bill very well.  A sort of classic of the genre. 8.</td>', 'Your image fits the bill very well.  A sort of classic of the genre. 8.', '2008-02-23 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509634, 648954, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition of shade and light. 8.</td>', 'Lovely composition of shade and light. 8.', '2008-02-23 10:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509636, 647377, 51538, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of our nearby botanic garden which also has a cherry tree esplanade.  Or are those apple trees perhaps?  I have always found it hard to photograph the esplanade being somewhat confused about where to focus the camera - at infinity?  Anyway, I have never been satisfied with the results when I look at the 100% view.  Yours seems much better. 8.</td>', 'Reminds me of our nearby botanic garden which also has a cherry tree esplanade.  Or are those apple trees perhaps?  I have always found it hard to photograph the esplanade being somewhat confused about where to focus the camera - at infinity?  Anyway, I have never been satisfied with the results when I look at the 100% view.  Yours seems much better. 8.', '2008-02-23 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509637, 648752, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like that little bit of Cornwall in there as well.  Nicely composed. 8.</td>', 'I like that little bit of Cornwall in there as well.  Nicely composed. 8.', '2008-02-23 10:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509640, 646757, 51538, '<td valign="top">Glad you took the photo in that direction, into the light.  The result is pleasing. 8.</td>', 'Glad you took the photo in that direction, into the light.  The result is pleasing. 8.', '2008-02-23 10:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509656, 648846, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like how the perspective makes the edges of the sign lead toward the tracks.  Kind of ironic since the challenge said the lines should lead to the "impact" of the image.  :)  Well done.  (Be careful around the tracks.)</td>', 'I like how the perspective makes the edges of the sign lead toward the tracks.  Kind of ironic since the challenge said the lines should lead to the "impact" of the image.  :)  Well done.  (Be careful around the tracks.)', '2008-02-23 11:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509671, 648888, 90380, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you already noticed that her right hand is not perfectly in position. This would have been worth another take in my opinion. But original idea, meets the challenge, and you sure are lucky to be somewhere so nice!!</td>', 'I''m sure you already noticed that her right hand is not perfectly in position. This would have been worth another take in my opinion. But original idea, meets the challenge, and you sure are lucky to be somewhere so nice!!', '2008-02-23 11:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509675, 648324, 90380, '<td valign="top">If the subject is supposed to be the people, I wish they would stand out a little better. Nice job at making the snow nice and white!</td>', 'If the subject is supposed to be the people, I wish they would stand out a little better. Nice job at making the snow nice and white!', '2008-02-23 11:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509697, 648779, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous purples and just enough detail.</td>', 'Gorgeous purples and just enough detail.', '2008-02-23 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509699, 648744, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I almost get the sensation of the blue being a gigantic rolling ball that is advancing on me.</td>', 'Very nice.  I almost get the sensation of the blue being a gigantic rolling ball that is advancing on me.', '2008-02-23 11:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509702, 646688, 90380, '<td valign="top">The most prominent leading lines in this one are leading to her butt. Was that intentional? I think that takes away from the sexiness somewhat, and makes it on the comedic side.</td>', 'The most prominent leading lines in this one are leading to her butt. Was that intentional? I think that takes away from the sexiness somewhat, and makes it on the comedic side.', '2008-02-23 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509703, 649047, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done; sky is particularly beautiful with the stars and wispy clouds.</td>', 'Very nicely done; sky is particularly beautiful with the stars and wispy clouds.', '2008-02-23 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509704, 647966, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great stop-action and lovely curvy leading line.</td>', 'Great stop-action and lovely curvy leading line.', '2008-02-23 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509848, 648764, 48963, '<td valign="top">at first i wanted more contrast in this photo - whiter whites, darker darks, but I think I like it just like it is. very very nice! 8</td>', 'at first i wanted more contrast in this photo - whiter whites, darker darks, but I think I like it just like it is. very very nice! 8', '2008-02-23 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
