(4512201, 649001, 89277, '<td valign="top">This is a little too overexposed for me. Also, a larger depth of field would have worked a little better. I do like the colors though</td>', 'This is a little too overexposed for me. Also, a larger depth of field would have worked a little better. I do like the colors though', '2008-02-24 15:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
