(4513010, 648861, 18367, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image that I am quite certain you will cherish for years to  come, but I do have a problem associating a leading line with the primary subject.  I have no problem with you sending me a PM to enlighten me as to what it is that I am missing.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image that I am quite certain you will cherish for years to  come, but I do have a problem associating a leading line with the primary subject.  I have no problem with you sending me a PM to enlighten me as to what it is that I am missing.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2008-02-24 22:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4513024, 648767, 18367, '<td valign="top">I am absolutely convinced that I voted on an almost identical image, but must admit I prefer your version.  Perhaps it is due to the contrast between the ground and the ominous sky, or the fact that the leading line is more visible and directs one view to the mountains.  Very nicely done, and the very best of luck to you.</td>', 'I am absolutely convinced that I voted on an almost identical image, but must admit I prefer your version.  Perhaps it is due to the contrast between the ground and the ominous sky, or the fact that the leading line is more visible and directs one view to the mountains.  Very nicely done, and the very best of luck to you.', '2008-02-24 22:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4513034, 647948, 18367, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but considering the slant of some of the buildings I will assume you used a rather wide angle lens.  You may have slightly over saturated your images since the tips of your trees have a blueish tinge to them.  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'A nice image, but considering the slant of some of the buildings I will assume you used a rather wide angle lens.  You may have slightly over saturated your images since the tips of your trees have a blueish tinge to them.  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2008-02-24 22:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4513037, 646960, 18367, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet ever so effective.  I do hope this does well.  Good luck.</td>', 'Simple, yet ever so effective.  I do hope this does well.  Good luck.', '2008-02-24 22:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4513091, 648377, 7810, '<td valign="top">A tough shot to get excited about ... you have a leading line it is a curb</td>', 'A tough shot to get excited about ... you have a leading line it is a curb', '2008-02-24 22:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4513110, 648954, 18367, '<td valign="top">A breathtaking image that most certainly meets the challenge criteria.  I do believe we will be seeing this one on the first page once the results are in.  Very well done indeed.</td>', 'A breathtaking image that most certainly meets the challenge criteria.  I do believe we will be seeing this one on the first page once the results are in.  Very well done indeed.', '2008-02-24 23:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
