(4513938, 648829, 30982, '<td valign="top">The path with the trees lining it makes a great example of leading lines.  Were this mine, I''d have composed without the post/ball structure.  It does provide an anchoring point, but it is also kind of overpowering here.  I like the long shadows across the path.  A bit sharper focus would add to this.</td>', 'The path with the trees lining it makes a great example of leading lines.  Were this mine, I''d have composed without the post/ball structure.  It does provide an anchoring point, but it is also kind of overpowering here.  I like the long shadows across the path.  A bit sharper focus would add to this.', '2008-02-25 07:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4514023, 648932, 67258, '<td valign="top">Now those are some inmpressive leading lines!  the tight framing suits the picture well, and helps to minimise the obvious ditractions.</td>', 'Now those are some inmpressive leading lines!  the tight framing suits the picture well, and helps to minimise the obvious ditractions.', '2008-02-25 08:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
