(4515315, 648908, 90658, '<td valign="top">Misty day or soft focus?  I would have like to see it pop more.  This is very subtle.</td>', 'Misty day or soft focus?  I would have like to see it pop more.  This is very subtle.', '2008-02-25 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515321, 647460, 90658, '<td valign="top">The character in this shot is incredible.  You captured the essence of this instrument beautifully.  I feel as if I can reach out and feel the wood and if I sit back, I could actually here the timbre of this viola.  Extremely well done.  This is a favorite -- 10!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'The character in this shot is incredible.  You captured the essence of this instrument beautifully.  I feel as if I can reach out and feel the wood and if I sit back, I could actually here the timbre of this viola.  Extremely well done.  This is a favorite -- 10!!!!!!!!!', '2008-02-25 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515324, 648738, 90658, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  Thanks for the smile.</td>', 'Hilarious!  Thanks for the smile.', '2008-02-25 14:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515325, 649060, 90658, '<td valign="top">Colors are wonderful.  Nice contrast between the yellow/gold and the deep blue.  Very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Colors are wonderful.  Nice contrast between the yellow/gold and the deep blue.  Very pleasing to the eye.', '2008-02-25 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515331, 648764, 85097, '<td valign="top">I like the gray tones to this.</td>', 'I like the gray tones to this.', '2008-02-25 14:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515332, 649028, 85097, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2008-02-25 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515333, 648734, 90658, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lack of focus here.  This shot would have lent itself really well to either focussing at the end of the road or the beginning of the road.  Use DOF to add dimension to the shot.  Right now the focus seems to be the leaves in the front left corner.</td>', 'There seems to be a lack of focus here.  This shot would have lent itself really well to either focussing at the end of the road or the beginning of the road.  Use DOF to add dimension to the shot.  Right now the focus seems to be the leaves in the front left corner.', '2008-02-25 14:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515335, 648851, 88054, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the theme. Where do the lines lead? A person...A train...This seems to take me nowhere. I''m looking for the subject. It could be anything. show me something that the lines lead to. Great idea just missing the subject.</td>', 'I''m missing the theme. Where do the lines lead? A person...A train...This seems to take me nowhere. I''m looking for the subject. It could be anything. show me something that the lines lead to. Great idea just missing the subject.', '2008-02-25 14:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515338, 649016, 88054, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Not much room for improvement. Perhaps a ball half way down the alley.</td>', 'Very nice. Not much room for improvement. Perhaps a ball half way down the alley.', '2008-02-25 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515357, 648803, 90658, '<td valign="top">The fog adds a bit of mystery to this.  I like it.</td>', 'The fog adds a bit of mystery to this.  I like it.', '2008-02-25 14:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515362, 648834, 90658, '<td valign="top">I almost think the headlights are too much.</td>', 'I almost think the headlights are too much.', '2008-02-25 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515367, 648561, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Seems a bit grainy. High ISO?</td>', 'Great concept. Seems a bit grainy. High ISO?', '2008-02-25 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515369, 648582, 90658, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I do like the reflection going off into the curve.  Perhaps, set the focus at the front causing "fading" towards the back.  This would add some movement.</td>', 'Well done.  I do like the reflection going off into the curve.  Perhaps, set the focus at the front causing "fading" towards the back.  This would add some movement.', '2008-02-25 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515384, 647860, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for people enjoying music.  That''s just me.  However, as a picture, or other art piece, it would have been more impactful to just have the instruments placed in their stands behind the mikes.  Otherwise, this is a good photo of a community event, worthy of a community newspaper.  Oh! BTW, the mikes sort of chop off the players heads.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for people enjoying music.  That''s just me.  However, as a picture, or other art piece, it would have been more impactful to just have the instruments placed in their stands behind the mikes.  Otherwise, this is a good photo of a community event, worthy of a community newspaper.  Oh! BTW, the mikes sort of chop off the players heads.', '2008-02-25 14:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515494, 648561, 29537, '<td valign="top">perhaps better with a deeper DOF</td>', 'perhaps better with a deeper DOF', '2008-02-25 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515524, 647416, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of leading lines!</td>', 'Excellent use of leading lines!', '2008-02-25 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515528, 648492, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly there are lines here, and they all lead to one point, but not to a subject but a vanishing point.</td>', 'Certainly there are lines here, and they all lead to one point, but not to a subject but a vanishing point.', '2008-02-25 15:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515591, 648641, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks very like York to me, near the train station!  A good tonal range, although the contrast between the dark tones of the stonework with the whited out sky is a bit much for my taste (if I am right and it is York, I reckon it was taken on the same day as mine...).  The composition uses leading lines as a compositional device rather than including them without a clear purpose and thus the photo fits the challenge well; I particular like the way the businessman''s shadow acts as a leading line to its owner!</td>', 'Looks very like York to me, near the train station!  A good tonal range, although the contrast between the dark tones of the stonework with the whited out sky is a bit much for my taste (if I am right and it is York, I reckon it was taken on the same day as mine...).  The composition uses leading lines as a compositional device rather than including them without a clear purpose and thus the photo fits the challenge well; I particular like the way the businessman''s shadow acts as a leading line to its owner!', '2008-02-25 15:27:11.000000', NULL, 1);
