(4515858, 648851, 90658, '<td valign="top">Not that I''d want to do it...but perhaps laying down on the sidewalk would give you a better perspective on the tracks.  This angle just looks like a snapshot of downtown.</td>', 'Not that I''d want to do it...but perhaps laying down on the sidewalk would give you a better perspective on the tracks.  This angle just looks like a snapshot of downtown.', '2008-02-25 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4515864, 647704, 90658, '<td valign="top">So desolate, and yet so incredibly beautiful.  The only thing that could make this a better shot is a blue sky or a black thundering sky, both of which you can''t achieve in basic (or without a weather machine). *9*</td>', 'So desolate, and yet so incredibly beautiful.  The only thing that could make this a better shot is a blue sky or a black thundering sky, both of which you can''t achieve in basic (or without a weather machine). *9*', '2008-02-25 17:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
