(4516208, 649019, 89277, '<td valign="top">The black and white really make this very effective. All the lines really beat the theme over my head and I really like that. The sky adds a nice break from lines though, I only wish you had added more of that.</td>', 'The black and white really make this very effective. All the lines really beat the theme over my head and I really like that. The sky adds a nice break from lines though, I only wish you had added more of that.', '2008-02-25 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
