(4516212, 648836, 89277, '<td valign="top">While I really like the star effect, I don''t think the road is very effective. The lights and color are really great though, I just think it could be better composed. Maybe move to the left.</td>', 'While I really like the star effect, I don''t think the road is very effective. The lights and color are really great though, I just think it could be better composed. Maybe move to the left.', '2008-02-25 18:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516221, 649030, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like being confused at first on what this is, but when I did I really enjoyed it. Beautifully lit, and very interesting. I just don''t like how the lines in the umbrella lead my eyes out of the picture.</td>', 'I really like being confused at first on what this is, but when I did I really enjoyed it. Beautifully lit, and very interesting. I just don''t like how the lines in the umbrella lead my eyes out of the picture.', '2008-02-25 18:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516227, 648696, 89277, '<td valign="top">The quality on this is rather low. Try shooting in RAW or don''t enlarge. I think you may have sharpened it too much too. I Think this might be a more interesting picture if you had the numbers on the ground in the shot as well.</td>', 'The quality on this is rather low. Try shooting in RAW or don''t enlarge. I think you may have sharpened it too much too. I Think this might be a more interesting picture if you had the numbers on the ground in the shot as well.', '2008-02-25 18:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516240, 648761, 89277, '<td valign="top">Very good use of psychological leading lines with the boat. I like the black and white as well. I sort of wish you tightened up the shot though or maybe included only one side of the harbor to make it a little more effective and dramatic</td>', 'Very good use of psychological leading lines with the boat. I like the black and white as well. I sort of wish you tightened up the shot though or maybe included only one side of the harbor to make it a little more effective and dramatic', '2008-02-25 18:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516244, 648968, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really love the contrast between the blue sky and pipes but it doesn''t work for me because it feels like you should have moved to the right so that the pipes come up from the bottom.</td>', 'I really love the contrast between the blue sky and pipes but it doesn''t work for me because it feels like you should have moved to the right so that the pipes come up from the bottom.', '2008-02-25 18:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
