(4516791, 647893, 14172, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the curved lines of the tunnel contrast with the leading lines of the escalator.  Works great as a BW.</td>', 'I really like the way the curved lines of the tunnel contrast with the leading lines of the escalator.  Works great as a BW.', '2008-02-25 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516794, 648111, 90451, '<td valign="top">Great photograph.  Wonderful yet stark balance.  I think the only thing that I could suggest to add would, perhaps, be a lone figure --a widow?-- kneeling in front of one of the gravestones in the distance, perhaps near the end of the leading lines.  This would make it a very powerful human image.</td>', 'Great photograph.  Wonderful yet stark balance.  I think the only thing that I could suggest to add would, perhaps, be a lone figure --a widow?-- kneeling in front of one of the gravestones in the distance, perhaps near the end of the leading lines.  This would make it a very powerful human image.', '2008-02-25 21:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516798, 648045, 14172, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that you got both great light and dark contrast and great color contrast... All with leading lines abounding.</td>', 'I love the fact that you got both great light and dark contrast and great color contrast... All with leading lines abounding.', '2008-02-25 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516801, 647771, 14172, '<td valign="top">I love the that the buildings add to the lines created by the cars.  Excellent color and contrast.</td>', 'I love the that the buildings add to the lines created by the cars.  Excellent color and contrast.', '2008-02-25 21:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516806, 647377, 14172, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  The leading lines to infinity are great, and I think the opposing shadows add a really nice element.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  The leading lines to infinity are great, and I think the opposing shadows add a really nice element.', '2008-02-25 21:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516811, 647966, 90451, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment, wonderful tension drawn by the leading line.  I only wish I knew what the person in the background was up to and why he/she is in the picture.</td>', 'Wonderful moment, wonderful tension drawn by the leading line.  I only wish I knew what the person in the background was up to and why he/she is in the picture.', '2008-02-25 21:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516825, 648495, 90451, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph. Luscious peaceful great and beautifully balanced line.  Great job.</td>', 'Lovely photograph. Luscious peaceful great and beautifully balanced line.  Great job.', '2008-02-25 21:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516849, 649008, 90451, '<td valign="top">Very fine portrait,however, I don''t see how you are using leading lines to thematically emphasize the subject''s face. Beautiful capture, however.</td>', 'Very fine portrait,however, I don''t see how you are using leading lines to thematically emphasize the subject''s face. Beautiful capture, however.', '2008-02-25 21:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516863, 649031, 90451, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, lovely lines.  Perhaps it could be even more powerful if you had some (in a car or on a horse) arrive or leaving in the distance down the road, since that''s where my eyes go.</td>', 'Nice capture, lovely lines.  Perhaps it could be even more powerful if you had some (in a car or on a horse) arrive or leaving in the distance down the road, since that''s where my eyes go.', '2008-02-25 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516885, 648065, 90451, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. The lines draw me throughout the photo, to the child, and then beyond.  However, I haven''t a clue to what''s just beyond the frame.  This is both good and unsatisfying.</td>', 'Very nice picture. The lines draw me throughout the photo, to the child, and then beyond.  However, I haven''t a clue to what''s just beyond the frame.  This is both good and unsatisfying.', '2008-02-25 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516887, 648946, 48268, '<td valign="top">I''d be kind of interested in seeing this in black and white.</td>', 'I''d be kind of interested in seeing this in black and white.', '2008-02-25 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516912, 648766, 90451, '<td valign="top">Great lines and super sky -- nicely converted to B&amp;W.  I love the contrast between the rural farm path and the high tech bridge.  Well done.</td>', 'Great lines and super sky -- nicely converted to B&W.  I love the contrast between the rural farm path and the high tech bridge.  Well done.', '2008-02-25 22:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516915, 646688, 90451, '<td valign="top">Provocative and edgy. Nicely done.  Love the hotspot behind the model. Good job.</td>', 'Provocative and edgy. Nicely done.  Love the hotspot behind the model. Good job.', '2008-02-25 22:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516933, 648908, 90579, '<td valign="top">Although I am new to all of this and am still taking my first photography course... I really like this one... you have allowed me to wonder on and up into this picture. I would like to see where it would take me if I was to walk upon it. I almost feel like I wouldn''t make it.... but I would keep on trying until I did!! Thanks for the picture!!</td>', 'Although I am new to all of this and am still taking my first photography course... I really like this one... you have allowed me to wonder on and up into this picture. I would like to see where it would take me if I was to walk upon it. I almost feel like I wouldn''t make it.... but I would keep on trying until I did!! Thanks for the picture!!', '2008-02-25 22:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516955, 648615, 88923, '<td valign="top">I really like the isolation of the rose hip and the clarity with the muted background.  9</td>', 'I really like the isolation of the rose hip and the clarity with the muted background.  9', '2008-02-25 22:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
