(4518197, 647502, 83313, '<td valign="top">JPEG police here....<br/> <br/>I really like this, but there did not seem to be the clarity that could have been in the details of the chess pieces. Your file size is a lot smaller than it could have been, and some of that great detail was probably lost to the use of excessive JPEG compression.</td>', 'JPEG police here.... I really like this, but there did not seem to be the clarity that could have been in the details of the chess pieces. Your file size is a lot smaller than it could have been, and some of that great detail was probably lost to the use of excessive JPEG compression.', '2008-02-26 13:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518203, 648050, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I like the look of the reflection more than the tree itself. Seems a little busy.</td>', 'I''m afraid I like the look of the reflection more than the tree itself. Seems a little busy.', '2008-02-26 13:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4518211, 648528, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ooooohhh, Ahhhhhhh!! I like it a lot, but... The horizon seems a bit too centered and the extra blue sky on the top is not adding anything else to this. Cropping about 20% off the top could work.</td>', 'Ooooohhh, Ahhhhhhh!! I like it a lot, but... The horizon seems a bit too centered and the extra blue sky on the top is not adding anything else to this. Cropping about 20% off the top could work.', '2008-02-26 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
