(4518784, 647612, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective view here. Three nitpicks though.<br/>1) colors need bumping up a little for impact, probably with a curves adjust would do nicely.<br/>2) the skew needs to be a little more, so that it is obvious that it is intended, or straightened out.<br/>3) crop a little more out of the sky, so that the horizon and subject are not so centered.</td>', 'I really like the perspective view here. Three nitpicks though.1) colors need bumping up a little for impact, probably with a curves adjust would do nicely.2) the skew needs to be a little more, so that it is obvious that it is intended, or straightened out.3) crop a little more out of the sky, so that the horizon and subject are not so centered.', '2008-02-26 17:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
