(4519725, 648849, 88136, '<td valign="top">good idea, i love these old things.  i would just suggest taking it from a lower angel, but the way you take it did make a good shadow. either way, you get a good pic:)</td>', 'good idea, i love these old things.  i would just suggest taking it from a lower angel, but the way you take it did make a good shadow. either way, you get a good pic:)', '2008-02-26 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519758, 648743, 89277, '<td valign="top">While really pretty and cool (I really like the colors)and well composed the compression looks funny. Maybe you sharpened it too much?</td>', 'While really pretty and cool (I really like the colors)and well composed the compression looks funny. Maybe you sharpened it too much?', '2008-02-26 23:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519761, 647460, 89277, '<td valign="top">I love violas and the colors are great.</td>', 'I love violas and the colors are great.', '2008-02-26 23:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519763, 647849, 89277, '<td valign="top">I love the texture on this, the black and white really enhances it. I also really like how my eye goes down from the top of the piece of metal on the left to the railroad tie to nowhere. Very nice use of depth of field as well, it very effectively makes the background a lot less distracting while still giving it a sense of place.</td>', 'I love the texture on this, the black and white really enhances it. I also really like how my eye goes down from the top of the piece of metal on the left to the railroad tie to nowhere. Very nice use of depth of field as well, it very effectively makes the background a lot less distracting while still giving it a sense of place.', '2008-02-26 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519765, 648813, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort, but there''s some perspective distortion on the right that hurts the impact of the strong lines. Adjusting curves to bring out the colors and detail of the brickwork would also help give this some oomph.</td>', 'Not a bad effort, but there''s some perspective distortion on the right that hurts the impact of the strong lines. Adjusting curves to bring out the colors and detail of the brickwork would also help give this some oomph.', '2008-02-26 23:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519766, 648766, 89277, '<td valign="top">A beautiful IR photo. I like how my eyes move along both the highway and the roadway in front of me. I am a little divided though on which one to look at though, maybe you should consider what you want the viewer to be looking at.</td>', 'A beautiful IR photo. I like how my eyes move along both the highway and the roadway in front of me. I am a little divided though on which one to look at though, maybe you should consider what you want the viewer to be looking at.', '2008-02-26 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519768, 649060, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really love the polarizing effect on the sky and the contrast between the roller coaster and the sky. However, this picture has too much roller coast for me. Maybe if you had put the coaster in front of the really blue sky and tightened up on it, it might have been a better photo</td>', 'I really love the polarizing effect on the sky and the contrast between the roller coaster and the sky. However, this picture has too much roller coast for me. Maybe if you had put the coaster in front of the really blue sky and tightened up on it, it might have been a better photo', '2008-02-26 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519770, 648744, 89277, '<td valign="top">While I really like the light and the colors in this, I don''t know exactly what I should be looking at</td>', 'While I really like the light and the colors in this, I don''t know exactly what I should be looking at', '2008-02-26 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519771, 648860, 83313, '<td valign="top">The strong flash seems to be highlighting mainly his legs.</td>', 'The strong flash seems to be highlighting mainly his legs.', '2008-02-26 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519772, 648953, 89277, '<td valign="top">These lines don''t really go anywhere. They are not dynamic enough for me...</td>', 'These lines don''t really go anywhere. They are not dynamic enough for me...', '2008-02-26 23:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519773, 646818, 89277, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but there is too much noise in the photo. Try shooting at a lower ISO.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but there is too much noise in the photo. Try shooting at a lower ISO.', '2008-02-26 23:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519775, 647954, 89277, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the clarity of the picture, but the composure leaves me kind of bored. Maybe if you cut down some of the top and bottom and cropped it a little better it would be better...</td>', 'I like the colors and the clarity of the picture, but the composure leaves me kind of bored. Maybe if you cut down some of the top and bottom and cropped it a little better it would be better...', '2008-02-26 23:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519777, 647966, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this. My only nitpick is the small silhouette visible on the beach and the tiny kite in the sky. If this was not a challenge, with strict editing rules, they would certainly be clone-outs.</td>', 'I like this. My only nitpick is the small silhouette visible on the beach and the tiny kite in the sky. If this was not a challenge, with strict editing rules, they would certainly be clone-outs.', '2008-02-26 23:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519778, 648529, 89277, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! Very nice use of leading lines and very good use of depth of field. Black and white may make this picture a little more effective though, even further making a contrast between the foreground and the background</td>', 'I love this picture! Very nice use of leading lines and very good use of depth of field. Black and white may make this picture a little more effective though, even further making a contrast between the foreground and the background', '2008-02-26 23:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519781, 648903, 89277, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were trying to do, but I think you should have tightened the shot, especially since there are people in there. Whenever people see people they want to see a lot of people and the shot would not have been worse off to have been tighter on them.</td>', 'I understand what you were trying to do, but I think you should have tightened the shot, especially since there are people in there. Whenever people see people they want to see a lot of people and the shot would not have been worse off to have been tighter on them.', '2008-02-26 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519782, 647704, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really lie the texture and colors here. the way you have composed the leading line of the fence with the mountains seems a little awkward to to me. Perhaps it is that the fence and mountain range are fighting for my attention as the subject.</td>', 'I really lie the texture and colors here. the way you have composed the leading line of the fence with the mountains seems a little awkward to to me. Perhaps it is that the fence and mountain range are fighting for my attention as the subject.', '2008-02-26 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519785, 648112, 89277, '<td valign="top">This is more of a snapshot. The lines lead, but they lead out of the picture, and what''s more don''t lead to anything particularly interesting. If I were you I would have composed this shot a little better and thought about the golden mean. I do like the light though, it is very interesting</td>', 'This is more of a snapshot. The lines lead, but they lead out of the picture, and what''s more don''t lead to anything particularly interesting. If I were you I would have composed this shot a little better and thought about the golden mean. I do like the light though, it is very interesting', '2008-02-26 23:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519787, 648054, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really neat looking. theres a fair amount of graininess on the ladybug, though. Your file size of 69k indicates there may be some detail loss due to JPEG compression. Always use a compression setting that gives you as large a file as you can manage to squeeze within the challenge limits.</td>', 'Really neat looking. theres a fair amount of graininess on the ladybug, though. Your file size of 69k indicates there may be some detail loss due to JPEG compression. Always use a compression setting that gives you as large a file as you can manage to squeeze within the challenge limits.', '2008-02-26 23:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519788, 648924, 89277, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just because I''m a sucker for patterns and a clear blue sky but I love this picture. The shades are great, the windows provide a cool pattern, but there aren''t any places for my eyes to go. Maybe if one of the windows were out it would be cooler?</td>', 'Maybe it''s just because I''m a sucker for patterns and a clear blue sky but I love this picture. The shades are great, the windows provide a cool pattern, but there aren''t any places for my eyes to go. Maybe if one of the windows were out it would be cooler?', '2008-02-26 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519790, 647966, 89277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful example of sillohuetting! Great use of leading lines and great timing! I really love the color on this too</td>', 'Beautiful example of sillohuetting! Great use of leading lines and great timing! I really love the color on this too', '2008-02-26 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519792, 648561, 89277, '<td valign="top">There is too much noise in the photograph, try shooting at a lower ISO. Also there is not much to look at, as the train is pretty drab and doesn''t really change much between the ground or the sky. Maybe if this was in black and white it would be more effective</td>', 'There is too much noise in the photograph, try shooting at a lower ISO. Also there is not much to look at, as the train is pretty drab and doesn''t really change much between the ground or the sky. Maybe if this was in black and white it would be more effective', '2008-02-26 23:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519795, 649059, 89277, '<td valign="top">While I immediately get the spirit of the picture (really great job on that btw) it does not feel chaotic enough to be a sugar buzz. Maybe with some motion blur or the kid not looking at the camera. Also the red eye kills me. Other than that, great job at using imagery to project a mood</td>', 'While I immediately get the spirit of the picture (really great job on that btw) it does not feel chaotic enough to be a sugar buzz. Maybe with some motion blur or the kid not looking at the camera. Also the red eye kills me. Other than that, great job at using imagery to project a mood', '2008-02-26 23:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519798, 647294, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like how simple this is. Very peaceful lines, good job!</td>', 'I really like how simple this is. Very peaceful lines, good job!', '2008-02-26 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519800, 649028, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really love the light but I don''t understand why you left the stem in the picture. The real interest is in the flower and all the negative space makes me wonder why you kept it in there... Other than that, really beautiful shot</td>', 'I really love the light but I don''t understand why you left the stem in the picture. The real interest is in the flower and all the negative space makes me wonder why you kept it in there... Other than that, really beautiful shot', '2008-02-26 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519801, 648789, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very emotive capture. Well done!</td>', 'Very emotive capture. Well done!', '2008-02-26 23:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519803, 648816, 89277, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of multiple lines all leading me sort of to the people or even the person in the window. Also the light feeling of this photo really adds to a sense of peace and wonder, probably how those people in the foreground feel haha. Really great shot, good job</td>', 'I like the combination of multiple lines all leading me sort of to the people or even the person in the window. Also the light feeling of this photo really adds to a sense of peace and wonder, probably how those people in the foreground feel haha. Really great shot, good job', '2008-02-26 23:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
