(4520057, 648903, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol @ufo and specs.  I always did believe that aliens liked the beach!  I think it''s cool to see those balloons in the sky - too bad they were not closer - that would have been fun!  What a beautiful day for shooting!  I''m going to be in FL in 3 days - I hope it''s this pretty when I get there!</td>', 'lol @ufo and specs.  I always did believe that aliens liked the beach!  I think it''s cool to see those balloons in the sky - too bad they were not closer - that would have been fun!  What a beautiful day for shooting!  I''m going to be in FL in 3 days - I hope it''s this pretty when I get there!', '2008-02-27 00:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
