(4520073, 648995, 69008, '<td valign="top">The concept of a line of laundry would have been better accepted by the voters if it had actually been hanging on a "line" outdoors, and photographed from near one end of the line. I guess that this shot didn''t have enough solid lines, or one good big one to make it go over well with the voters. Anyway, thank you for saving me from getting the brown ribbon in this "Leading Lines" challenge. I hope that you will keep shooting, and that scores will improve soon for your images.</td>', 'The concept of a line of laundry would have been better accepted by the voters if it had actually been hanging on a "line" outdoors, and photographed from near one end of the line. I guess that this shot didn''t have enough solid lines, or one good big one to make it go over well with the voters. Anyway, thank you for saving me from getting the brown ribbon in this "Leading Lines" challenge. I hope that you will keep shooting, and that scores will improve soon for your images.', '2008-02-27 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4520079, 648954, 28742, '<td valign="top">Once again, I am so glad you''re back. Love this alot! Congrats!</td>', 'Once again, I am so glad you''re back. Love this alot! Congrats!', '2008-02-27 00:55:13.000000', NULL, 0),
