(4520497, 648294, 3724, '<td valign="top">This well made close view has a lot going for it - use of a traditional subject is very basic, but unique idea applied to this challenge.  A fine texture linear weave - a swatch, a shroud, w/play of light on interesting, though minimal, curved fabric folds, &amp; a shallow dof. I think the result a good abstract.</td>', 'This well made close view has a lot going for it - use of a traditional subject is very basic, but unique idea applied to this challenge.  A fine texture linear weave - a swatch, a shroud, w/play of light on interesting, though minimal, curved fabric folds, & a shallow dof. I think the result a good abstract.', '2008-02-27 06:46:30.000000', NULL, 0),
