(4520526, 649031, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mark_u_U:</b></div><hr/><i> I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This Mr copied and pasted this alot! Was so strict with his idea of leading lines... hehehe anyway I do think this could have been higher =( damn voters...</td>', 'Originally posted by mark_u_U: I am not sure whether there is an unambigious definition of leading lines, but in my book, they should be a line or several lines that lead the viewer''s eye towards the main subject of the picture. I think that''s not the case in this picture. Your pic uses a vanishing point rather than leading lines.   This Mr copied and pasted this alot! Was so strict with his idea of leading lines... hehehe anyway I do think this could have been higher =( damn voters...', '2008-02-27 07:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4520528, 648995, 55892, '<td valign="top">Well, the  only way to go from here is up!  I was attempting to illustrate the saying, "Wash on Monday, iron on Tuesday" &amp; so on, ending on "Rest on Sunday."  You know, the chaotic yet mundane chores of every day living.  I should have put the camera away &amp; washed those clothes! <br/>Maybe some day it will be used in another Brown Ribbon do over. I got a lot of very constructive criticism &amp; appreciate the kindness in the way they were made.  BTW, this was the 1st time I used the Unsharp &amp; Resharpen editing tools, just look at the stunning color in those blue jeans!</td>', 'Well, the  only way to go from here is up!  I was attempting to illustrate the saying, "Wash on Monday, iron on Tuesday" & so on, ending on "Rest on Sunday."  You know, the chaotic yet mundane chores of every day living.  I should have put the camera away & washed those clothes! Maybe some day it will be used in another Brown Ribbon do over. I got a lot of very constructive criticism & appreciate the kindness in the way they were made.  BTW, this was the 1st time I used the Unsharp & Resharpen editing tools, just look at the stunning color in those blue jeans!', '2008-02-27 07:17:37.000000', NULL, 0),
