(4520788, 648936, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly can be cold out there, especially when that wind picks up!  :-)<br/> <br/>Thought I recognized this pier at first glance, but it''s not St. Joe...South Haven maybe?  Hmmm.<br/> <br/>Don''t want to hijack your photo thread, so I''ll just post the photo id # (456230).  St. Joseph in January...VERY cold!<br/> <br/>BTW - I loved your play on words in your title.  :)<br/> <br/>Edit - typo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-27 09:00:58.</i></td>', 'Certainly can be cold out there, especially when that wind picks up!  :-) Thought I recognized this pier at first glance, but it''s not St. Joe...South Haven maybe?  Hmmm. Don''t want to hijack your photo thread, so I''ll just post the photo id # (456230).  St. Joseph in January...VERY cold! BTW - I loved your play on words in your title.  :) Edit - typo.', '2008-02-27 09:00:12.000000', '2008-02-27 09:00:58.000000', 0),
