(4522563, 648522, 33352, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first top 20 finish, very nice shot like the use of shadows &amp; highlights.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first top 20 finish, very nice shot like the use of shadows & highlights.', '2008-02-27 15:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
