(4523471, 649057, 20530, '<td valign="top">Good shot! The sky is great. Another "insider" image. I appreciate it, and hope it brings you good memories (of the day before the sunburn kicked in;)</td>', 'Good shot! The sky is great. Another "insider" image. I appreciate it, and hope it brings you good memories (of the day before the sunburn kicked in;)', '2008-02-27 20:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
