(4523555, 648954, 5286, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the votes and the comments! It was definitely a very pleasant surprise to ribbon with this :). It''s great to be back, this is my second challenge after a little over a year''s break from DPC!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the votes and the comments! It was definitely a very pleasant surprise to ribbon with this :). It''s great to be back, this is my second challenge after a little over a year''s break from DPC!', '2008-02-27 20:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4523834, 648080, 88575, '<td valign="top">Well, I was disqualified.  I burned out the small earring that seemed to be hanging in mid air.  I''m learning!!</td>', 'Well, I was disqualified.  I burned out the small earring that seemed to be hanging in mid air.  I''m learning!!', '2008-02-27 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
