(4524185, 647704, 89005, '<td valign="top">This is simply one of the best photos i have seen. It is something about the colors, and the smoothness. <br/> <br/>I have tried to eat a piece of the photo, but stopped again realizing my computer screen only got wet.<br/>I will try again though because it''s so smooth.</td>', 'This is simply one of the best photos i have seen. It is something about the colors, and the smoothness.  I have tried to eat a piece of the photo, but stopped again realizing my computer screen only got wet.I will try again though because it''s so smooth.', '2008-02-28 03:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4524309, 648766, 22459, '<td valign="top">Well deserved Ribbon. This is really a striking B&amp;W conversion actually one of the great B&amp;W shots on this site. <br/> <br/>One has to ask who are the four dickheads who voted this a 1 or 2 ???<br/></td>', 'Well deserved Ribbon. This is really a striking B&W conversion actually one of the great B&W shots on this site.  One has to ask who are the four dickheads who voted this a 1 or 2 ???', '2008-02-28 06:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
