(4526925, 648987, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the flare of the long coat.  Gives this an immediacy - the sense of a single moment.</td>', 'I love the flare of the long coat.  Gives this an immediacy - the sense of a single moment.', '2008-02-29 03:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4526934, 648903, 30982, '<td valign="top">No, it''s not a bad photo.  And I recognized the blimp as a blimp.  I suspect your "leading lines" weren''t strong enough for very literal voters.  And I''ll be one of the unwashed, unclean - but I like people in pictures.  :-)</td>', 'No, it''s not a bad photo.  And I recognized the blimp as a blimp.  I suspect your "leading lines" weren''t strong enough for very literal voters.  And I''ll be one of the unwashed, unclean - but I like people in pictures.  :-)', '2008-02-29 03:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
