(4535906, 648757, 52992, '<td valign="top">I think it''s wonderful Deb - lighter and you''d have lost the ambiance in favor of detail.  Detail that, I feel, would have been distracting and un-needed in this photo.</td>', 'I think it''s wonderful Deb - lighter and you''d have lost the ambiance in favor of detail.  Detail that, I feel, would have been distracting and un-needed in this photo.', '2008-03-03 16:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
