(4539471, 646960, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, except the snow at the bottom ends up looking like a giant white border.  How''s it look with that cropped out?<br/> <br/>And Juliboc''s reaction, thinking it didn''t load, is hilarious!  I can absolutely see why she thought that. :)</td>', 'I like the shot, except the snow at the bottom ends up looking like a giant white border.  How''s it look with that cropped out? And Juliboc''s reaction, thinking it didn''t load, is hilarious!  I can absolutely see why she thought that. :)', '2008-03-05 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539477, 648861, 60862, '<td valign="top">A thoroughly confusing and disorienting image.  Well done!  Okay, so the lines aren''t particularly leading.  But aside from the challenge, it''s like some weird postcard you''d find in a diner 100 miles from the nearest city on a cross-country drive.</td>', 'A thoroughly confusing and disorienting image.  Well done!  Okay, so the lines aren''t particularly leading.  But aside from the challenge, it''s like some weird postcard you''d find in a diner 100 miles from the nearest city on a cross-country drive.', '2008-03-05 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
