(4539489, 648944, 60862, '<td valign="top">Boy, I must be weird, because I see one set of leading lines leading to another set leading me to want to step to the right to see what''s to the left.</td>', 'Boy, I must be weird, because I see one set of leading lines leading to another set leading me to want to step to the right to see what''s to the left.', '2008-03-05 01:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539499, 648903, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s kind of a typical beach scene, without anything to really grab me.  But it''s nicely composed, the leading lines are obvious to me, it''s well exposed.  So it would''ve been a 5 had I voted on it.<br/> <br/>Just ignore 1s and 2s.  There are so few pictures that really deserve those scores that it''s not worth worrying about them.  I''d guess they''re from people who need a very strong, obvious leading line.</td>', 'Well, it''s kind of a typical beach scene, without anything to really grab me.  But it''s nicely composed, the leading lines are obvious to me, it''s well exposed.  So it would''ve been a 5 had I voted on it. Just ignore 1s and 2s.  There are so few pictures that really deserve those scores that it''s not worth worrying about them.  I''d guess they''re from people who need a very strong, obvious leading line.', '2008-03-05 01:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
