(4539858, 648071, 3724, '<td valign="top">Interesting equipment choice. I enjoy the idea of a lensbaby attached to a point &amp; shoot, has a quixotic, whimsical make do, can do quality about it. The result in this is nice - fyi 7.</td>', 'Interesting equipment choice. I enjoy the idea of a lensbaby attached to a point & shoot, has a quixotic, whimsical make do, can do quality about it. The result in this is nice - fyi 7.', '2008-03-05 06:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4540138, 648259, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Xuko:</b></div><hr/><i> Okay, I was really stupid on this one.  I miss read the challenge and thought the "Leading Lines" were from a movie and this was my attempt at Dirty Harry.  What can I say?   It is one of my better shots....poop! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not stupid, it was an honest misunderstanding of the intended message. It''s a pretty good shot actually and would do good in a ''Movie Line'' challenge. <br/> <br/>Cheers</td>', 'Originally posted by Xuko: Okay, I was really stupid on this one.  I miss read the challenge and thought the "Leading Lines" were from a movie and this was my attempt at Dirty Harry.  What can I say?   It is one of my better shots....poop!   Not stupid, it was an honest misunderstanding of the intended message. It''s a pretty good shot actually and would do good in a ''Movie Line'' challenge.  Cheers', '2008-03-05 09:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4543604, 648987, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like the setup of this shot. Wonderful setup. Just a thought, I might be tempted to crop off the top a bit, just so there is no light up there. I realize you were going for the architecture of the building, but this might have more a visual impact. Your mileage may vary though. But beyond my unrequested two cents, I really do like this picture. A very well done shot and I can''t stress enough how good the lighting and setup are. Superb.</td>', 'I really like the setup of this shot. Wonderful setup. Just a thought, I might be tempted to crop off the top a bit, just so there is no light up there. I realize you were going for the architecture of the building, but this might have more a visual impact. Your mileage may vary though. But beyond my unrequested two cents, I really do like this picture. A very well done shot and I can''t stress enough how good the lighting and setup are. Superb.', '2008-03-06 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4543606, 648952, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think I have been around too long when I start remembering locations. The long figure really gives a good reference to the frame. The contrast are also magnificent. Congrats on the high place, touch field in this challenge.</td>', 'I think I have been around too long when I start remembering locations. The long figure really gives a good reference to the frame. The contrast are also magnificent. Congrats on the high place, touch field in this challenge.', '2008-03-06 15:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
